      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Robert is having a very peaceful transition in your arms, guided by morphine to keep him comfortable and free from pain. His breathing patterns like Cheyne-Stokes are simply his body's natural rhythm as he settles, and he remains deeply loved by all who hold him. We believe in sending him on to a quiet, eternal rest within the next day or two, offering you, the Miller family, time to stay close and cherish every shared moment. Would you like me to check this against a simple sentiment check to ensure it feels gentle yet honest?",
